      "chapter": "cards",
      "durationTarget": 10,
      "image": "",
      "subtitle": "概念用 cards，標題一行、說明兩行以內。",
      "narration": "概念用 cards。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "items": [
            {
              "title": "官方",
              "text": "廠商自己公布的數字，可直接引用。"
            },
            {
              "title": "社群",
              "text": "使用者實測回報，需標明樣本與日期。"
            },
            {
              "title": "估算",
              "text": "我們推導的數字，必須寫明推導方式。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "motion": "rise"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-03",
      "title": "list：一次講五件事的上限",
      "chapter": "list",
      "durationTarget": 10,
      "image": "",
      "subtitle": "步驟用 list，最多五項，超過就拆頁。",
      "narration": "步驟用 list。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "items": [
            "storyboard 寫下意圖",
            "prepare-tts 產生朗讀稿",
            "tts 生成旁白",
            "measure 量測實際長度",
            "sync 回寫所有時間軸"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "motion": "hold"
    },
    {
      "id": "slide-04",
      "title": "quote：讓一句話占住畫面",
      "chapter": "quote",
      "durationTarget": 10,
      "image": "",
      "subtitle": "結論或引述用 quote，一頁只放一則。",
      "narration": "結論用 quote。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "永遠不要用估計的秒數 render；先量 MP3，再決定要縮稿還是延長頁面。",
          "source": "shared/docs/hyperframes-production-playbook.md §4.6"
        },
        {
          "type": "source",
          "text": "此規則來自 2026-06 的旁白截斷事故。"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "rise"
    },
